<view class="page-shell profile-editor"><page-nav title="编辑简介" show-back="{{!mandatory && !loadingProfile}}"></page-nav><view wx:if="{{mandatory && !loadingProfile && !loadError}}" class="onboarding-note"><view class="onboarding-title">欢迎，先完善一下简介吧</view><view>填写昵称和个人简介并保存后，即可使用小程序。保存成功后会带你了解各项功能。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loadingProfile}}" class="onboarding-note">正在连接账号…</view><view wx:if="{{loadError}}" class="onboarding-note"><view>{{loadError}}</view><button class="retry-profile" bindtap="retryProfile">重新连接</button></view><block wx:if="{{!loadingProfile && !loadError}}"><view class="editor-card card"><view class="field-label">个人头像（选填）</view><view wx:if="{{avatar}}" class="avatar-crop-area"><view class="avatar-crop-circle tap" bindtap="editAvatar"><image class="avatar-crop-image" src="{{avatar}}" mode="aspectFill" style="transform: translate({{avatarOffsetX}}rpx, {{avatarOffsetY}}rpx) scale({{avatarScale}});"></image></view><view class="crop-tip">点击头像进入全屏编辑，可拖动位置并双指缩放。</view><view class="avatar-photo-actions"><view class="mini-photo-button tap" bindtap="editAvatar">全屏调整</view><view class="mini-photo-button secondary tap" bindtap="chooseAvatar">更换照片</view><view class="clear-avatar tap" bindtap="clearAvatar">移除照片</view></view></view><view wx:else class="avatar-picker tap" bindtap="chooseAvatar"><view class="avatar-plus">＋</view><view>从相册选择头像</view></view><view class="field-label">昵称（必填）</view><input class="text-input" placeholder="（给自己起一个昵称）" maxlength="12" value="{{name}}" data-field="name" bindinput="input"/><view class="field-label">个人简介（{{mandatory ? '必填' : '选填'}}）</view><textarea class="body-input" placeholder="（写下一份个人签名吧，可以是眼中的自己，也可以是想说的话，甚至是一段座右铭……）" maxlength="240" value="{{bio}}" data-field="bio" bindinput="input" auto-height="{{true}}"/><view class="field-label">我的标签（选填，每个最多10字）</view><input class="text-input" placeholder="（如“乐观”、“自信”；用顿号分隔）" maxlength="80" value="{{tagsText}}" data-field="tagsText" bindinput="input"/><view class="stats-hint">最多 6 个标签，每个标签不能超过 10 个字。</view><view class="field-label">同行年限与社群经历（选填）</view><view class="stats-inputs"><view class="stat-field"><text>（</text><input type="number" value="{{age}}" data-field="age" bindinput="input"/><text>）</text><text>年同行年限</text></view><view class="stat-field"><text>（</text><input type="number" value="{{campCount}}" data-field="campCount" bindinput="input"/><text>）</text><text>段社群经历</text></view></view><view class="stats-hint">可以留空；填写时请输入 0 或正整数。</view></view><button class="btn-primary save-btn" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}" bindtap="save">保存简介</button></block></view><avatar-cropper visible="{{avatarCropVisible}}" source="{{avatarCropSource}}" initial-scale="{{avatarCropScale}}" initial-offset-x="{{avatarCropOffsetX}}" initial-offset-y="{{avatarCropOffsetY}}" bind:cancel="avatarCropCancel" bind:complete="avatarCropComplete"></avatar-cropper>
